Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.25,0:22:48.30,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}你是否将独自行动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.67,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}你又会得到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:50.52,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}请宣誓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.79,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}请你绝不能忘记Solo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.79,0:22:54.68,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}你要再创佳绩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:22:56.53,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)} 伸出双手 迎接成功
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.53,0:22:58.58,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}伸出双手 我接着你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.58,0:23:00.73,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}冲破一切 伸出双手
